---
description: Build an interactive course from a codebase (Understory)
globs: ["chapters/*.html", "course.json"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `INSTRUCTIONS.md` at the repository root.

Chapters are generated by `python3 scaffold.py chapter <n> <slug> --parts …`
and then filled in: replace the `TODO` text and nothing else. Parts are wired
by `data-u` attributes, so never write an inline `onclick` and never invent a
handler name.

Code shown to the reader must appear verbatim in the source repository —
choose a shorter passage rather than trimming a long one.

A chapter is not done until `python3 build.py && python3 verify.py --src <repo>`
exits clean.
